{% comment %}
  Cellexia Reviews — "Overall reviews" brand-wide theme app block (SPEC-1.9 §2).

  Placeable on the home page or any sections-enabled OS 2.0 page. Everything is
  SSR'd from the two app-synced SHOP metafields — `cellexia.shop_rating`
  ({ average, count, verifiedPercent, distribution }) and
  `cellexia.shop_top_reviews` (up to 12 display-ready entries) — so the first
  paint costs zero fetches. assets/cellexia-reviews.js (initOverall) then adds
  read-more toggles, the carousel prev/next buttons and the distribution-bar
  star filter (GET /brand-reviews).

  Nil-guards everywhere. v1.10 (SPEC-1.10 §5C): when `shop_rating.count` is 0
  (or the metafield is absent/invalid — every fresh install before its first
  syncShopRating) the block no longer vanishes: it renders a HIDDEN data-less
  shell (`data-cx-overall-empty="true"`, always `hidden`) plus assets + i18n.
  In merchant contexts (design mode or a valid preview token) the JS fills it
  client-side from GET /brand-reviews — so preview works BEFORE any metafield
  sync — and shows the merchant-only `notice.overall_pending` when the shop
  genuinely has zero reviews. Shoppers on a live store still see nothing.

  Live/preview gating is identical to blocks/reviews.liquid (SPEC-1.2/1.6):
  only an explicit `cellexia.live == false` means "not live"; the theme editor
  (request.design_mode) always shows the block and carries the design-mode-only
  editor token. Not live on the real storefront ⇒ the root ships `hidden` —
  per SPEC-1.9 §3 the SSR content is already hidden by the shell, and the JS
  un-hides it ONLY for tokenized admin previews (no token ⇒ zero fetches,
  zero pixels). Shoppers never see tokens, notices or error boxes.

  Deliberately NO JSON-LD anywhere in this block: Google ignores self-serving
  Organization ratings, so we emit none (docs/SEO.md). The product pages carry
  the rich-snippet markup.
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign cx_o_stats = nil
  if shop.metafields.cellexia.shop_rating
    assign cx_o_stats = shop.metafields.cellexia.shop_rating.value
  endif
  assign cx_o_count = 0
  if cx_o_stats
    assign cx_o_count = cx_o_stats.count | default: 0 | times: 1
  endif
-%}
{{ 'cellexia-reviews.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{%- liquid
  assign cx_o_avg = cx_o_stats.average | default: 0 | times: 1.0
  assign cx_o_vp = cx_o_stats.verifiedPercent | default: 0 | times: 1
  assign cx_o_dist = cx_o_stats.distribution

  assign cx_o_top = nil
  assign cx_o_top_size = 0
  if shop.metafields.cellexia.shop_top_reviews
    assign cx_o_top = shop.metafields.cellexia.shop_top_reviews.value
    if cx_o_top
      assign cx_o_top_size = cx_o_top.size
    endif
  endif

  comment
    Gating — byte-for-byte the reviews.liquid rules, market-aware since
    v1.14 (SPEC-1.14 §3): the cx-live snippet decides (wrapper comments
    stripped per SPEC-1.8 §5); the theme editor always shows the full block;
    the preview token is emitted ONLY in design mode and never on a normal
    storefront request.
  endcomment
  capture cx_live_raw
    render 'cx-live'
  endcapture
  assign cx_live_raw = cx_live_raw | remove: '<!-- BEGIN app snippet: cx-live -->' | remove: '<!-- END app snippet -->' | strip
  assign cx_is_live = true
  if cx_live_raw != '1'
    assign cx_is_live = false
  endif
  assign cx_show_full = cx_is_live
  if request.design_mode
    assign cx_show_full = true
  endif
  assign cx_editor_token = ''
  if request.design_mode
    assign cx_editor_token = shop.metafields.cellexia.preview_token.value | default: '' | append: '' | strip
  endif

  assign cx_lang = request.locale.iso_code | split: '-' | first

  comment
    v1.1/v1.3 design version — unknown/missing values fall back to "amazon",
    identical to blocks/reviews.liquid.
  endcomment
  assign cx_skin = 'amazon'
  case shop.metafields.cellexia.design_theme.value
    when 'cellexia'
      assign cx_skin = 'cellexia'
    when 'luxe'
      assign cx_skin = 'luxe'
  endcase

  comment
    v1.27.1: the heading SETTING is stored once, in the language the block
    was added in, so every other storefront language kept showing it raw.
    When the stored value is still a DEFAULT (the English default or this
    locale's own), serve the shopper-locale string from the storefront
    locale files instead; a merchant-customized heading is kept as-is
    (v1.12.1 accent_color sentinel pattern).
  endcomment
  assign cx_o_heading = block.settings.heading
  assign cx_o_heading_t = 'cellexia.overall.heading_default' | t
  assign cx_o_heading_cmp = cx_o_heading | strip
  if cx_o_heading_cmp == 'What our customers say' or cx_o_heading_cmp == cx_o_heading_t
    assign cx_o_heading = cx_o_heading_t
  endif

  comment
    v1.27.1: locale-aware product links. routes.root_url is "/" on the
    primary locale and "/fr" (possibly with a trailing slash) elsewhere —
    normalize to no-trailing-slash so root + "/products/x" is always valid.
    Card titles/URLs resolve through all_products[handle] (translated per
    request locale, URL locale-prefixed); the stored metafield title is only
    the fallback (deleted product). Up to 12 unique handles, safely under
    Shopify's 20-per-page all_products cap.
  endcomment
  assign cx_root = routes.root_url | default: '/'
  assign cx_root_last = cx_root | slice: -1, 1
  if cx_root_last == '/'
    assign cx_root_size = cx_root.size | minus: 1
    assign cx_root = cx_root | slice: 0, cx_root_size
  endif

  assign cx_o_max = block.settings.max_reviews | default: 6
  assign cx_o_layout = 'grid'
  if block.settings.layout == 'carousel'
    assign cx_o_layout = 'carousel'
  endif
  assign cx_o_rating_str = cx_o_avg | round: 1 | append: ''
  assign cx_o_count_str = cx_o_count | append: ''
  assign cx_o_vp_str = cx_o_vp | append: ''
-%}
{%- comment -%}
  v1.8 (SPEC-1.8 §5): Shopify wraps every render of an app snippet in
  "BEGIN/END app snippet" HTML comments — even inside capture and attribute
  values — so the proxy path must be captured once and stripped of the exact
  wrapper strings (harmless when Shopify omits the comments). This rule
  applies to EVERY value-context render site; cx-proxy is the only one here.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture cx_proxy -%}{% render 'cx-proxy' %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign cx_proxy = cx_proxy | remove: '<!-- BEGIN app snippet: cx-proxy -->' | remove: '<!-- END app snippet -->' | strip -%}
{%- comment -%}
  v1.27.1: handle → { t: locale title, u: locale URL } map for the JS
  re-renders (translated-mode swap, star filters, editor preview) — the API
  serves DB rows in the store's primary language only. Values go through
  `json` plus a `<`→\u003c rewrite (SPEC-1.19 lesson: json escapes neither
  `<` nor `/`, and this string lands in an HTML attribute). Deduped by
  pipe-wrapped handle so `contains` can never match a substring.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture cx_o_pmap -%}
{%- assign cx_o_pmap_seen = '' -%}
{%- for cx_r in cx_o_top -%}
{%- if cx_r.productHandle == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign cx_o_hkey = cx_r.productHandle | prepend: '|' | append: '|' -%}
{%- if cx_o_pmap_seen contains cx_o_hkey -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign cx_rp = all_products[cx_r.productHandle] -%}
{%- if cx_rp.title == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if cx_o_pmap_seen != '' -%},{%- endif -%}{{ cx_r.productHandle | json }}:{"t":{{ cx_rp.title | json | replace: '<', '\u003c' }},"u":{{ cx_rp.url | json | replace: '<', '\u003c' }}}
{%- assign cx_o_pmap_seen = cx_o_pmap_seen | append: cx_o_hkey -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
<div
  class="cx cx-overall"
  {% if cx_lang == 'ar' %}dir="rtl"{% endif %}
  data-locale="{{ request.locale.iso_code }}"
  data-translation-display="{{ shop.metafields.cellexia.translation_display.value | default: 'original' }}"
  data-proxy="{{ cx_proxy }}"
  data-root-url="{{ routes.root_url }}"
  data-cx-pmap="{ {{ cx_o_pmap | escape }} }"
  data-heading="{{ cx_o_heading | escape }}"
  data-max-reviews="{{ cx_o_max }}"
  data-layout="{{ cx_o_layout }}"
  data-show-distribution="{{ block.settings.show_distribution }}"
  data-show-product-links="{{ block.settings.show_product_links }}"
  {% if block.settings.cta_label != blank %}data-cta-label="{{ block.settings.cta_label | escape }}"{% endif %}
  {% if block.settings.cta_url != blank %}data-cta-url="{{ block.settings.cta_url | escape }}"{% endif %}
  data-demo="false"
  data-cx-skin="{{ cx_skin }}"
  data-cx-live="{{ cx_show_full }}"
  {% if cx_editor_token != blank %}data-cx-editor-token="{{ cx_editor_token | escape }}"{% endif %}
  {% comment %}
    v1.10 §5C: with SSR data the shell hides only when not live (unchanged);
    a data-less shell ships hidden ALWAYS — only the merchant-context JS
    render (design mode / valid preview token) un-hides it.
  {% endcomment %}
  {% if cx_o_count > 0 %}{% unless cx_show_full %}hidden{% endunless %}{% else %}data-cx-overall-empty="true" hidden{% endif %}
>
  {%- if cx_o_count > 0 -%}
  <div class="cx-overall__header">
    {%- if cx_o_heading != blank -%}
    <h2 class="cx-overall__heading">{{ cx_o_heading | escape }}</h2>
    {%- endif -%}
    <div class="cx-overall__score">
      {% render 'cx-stars', rating: cx_o_avg, size: 28 %}
      <span class="cx-avg-text">{{ 'cellexia.widget.rating_out_of' | t: rating: cx_o_rating_str | replace: '[[rating]]', cx_o_rating_str }}</span>
    </div>
    <p class="cx-overall__based">{{ 'cellexia.overall.based_on' | t: count: cx_o_count_str | replace: '[[count]]', cx_o_count_str }}</p>
    {%- if cx_o_vp >= 60 -%}
    <p class="cx-overall__trust">{{ 'cellexia.overall.verified_share' | t: percent: cx_o_vp_str | replace: '[[percent]]', cx_o_vp_str }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- if block.settings.show_distribution and cx_o_dist -%}
  <div class="cx-dist cx-overall__dist" role="group">
    {%- for cx_i in (1..5) reversed -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign cx_i_str = cx_i | append: ''
      assign cx_row = cx_o_dist[cx_i_str]
      assign cx_pct_val = 0
      if cx_row
        assign cx_pct_val = cx_row.percent | default: 0
      endif
      assign cx_pct_str = cx_pct_val | append: ''
    -%}
    <button
      type="button"
      class="cx-dist__row"
      data-stars="{{ cx_i }}"
      aria-pressed="false"
      aria-label="{{ 'cellexia.a11y.filter_row' | t: stars: cx_i_str | replace: '[[stars]]', cx_i_str | escape }}"
    >
      <span class="cx-dist__label">{{ 'cellexia.widget.star_row' | t: count: cx_i | replace: '[[count]]', cx_i_str }}</span>
      <span class="cx-dist__bar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cx-dist__fill" style="inline-size:{{ cx_pct_val }}%"></span></span>
      <span class="cx-dist__percent" aria-hidden="true">{{ 'cellexia.widget.percent' | t: percent: cx_pct_str | replace: '[[percent]]', cx_pct_str }}</span>
    </button>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="cx-overall__cards cx-overall__cards--{{ cx_o_layout }}" data-cx-overall-cards aria-live="polite">
    {%- if cx_o_count > 0 and cx_o_top_size > 0 -%}
    {%- for cx_r in cx_o_top limit: cx_o_max -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign cx_r_author = cx_r.author | default: ''
      assign cx_r_date_fmt = cx_r.date | date: '%B %d, %Y'
      assign cx_r_prc = cx_r.productReviewCount | default: 0 | times: 1
      assign cx_r_prc_str = cx_r_prc | append: ''

      comment
        v1.27.1: shopper-locale product title + locale-prefixed URL via
        all_products (see the assigns block up top); the metafield title and
        a hand-built root+handle URL only cover a since-deleted product.
      endcomment
      assign cx_r_ptitle = cx_r.productTitle
      assign cx_r_purl = ''
      if cx_r.productHandle != blank
        assign cx_rp = all_products[cx_r.productHandle]
        if cx_rp.title != blank
          assign cx_r_ptitle = cx_rp.title
          assign cx_r_purl = cx_rp.url
        endif
        if cx_r_purl == blank
          assign cx_r_purl = cx_root | append: '/products/' | append: cx_r.productHandle
        endif
      endif
    -%}
    <article class="cx-card cx-overall__card">
      <div class="cx-card__titleline">
        {% render 'cx-stars', rating: cx_r.rating, size: 16 %}
        {%- if cx_r.title != blank -%}<strong class="cx-card__title">{{ cx_r.title | escape }}</strong>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <div class="cx-overall__body cx-clamp"><p>{{ cx_r.body | escape | newline_to_br }}</p></div>
      <p class="cx-card__meta">
        {%- if cx_r_author != blank -%}<span class="cx-card__author">{{ cx_r_author | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
        {%- if cx_r_author != blank and cx_r_date_fmt %} <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> {% endif -%}
        {%- comment -%} v1.27.1: data-cx-date lets the JS re-render the English-formatted SSR date in the shopper's locale {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if cx_r_date_fmt -%}<span data-cx-date="{{ cx_r.date | escape }}">{{ cx_r_date_fmt }}</span>{%- endif -%}
      </p>
      {%- if cx_r.verified -%}
      <p class="cx-badge-verified">{{ 'cellexia.review.verified' | t }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if cx_r.hasMedia -%}
      <p class="cx-overall__media"><span class="cx-overall__mediadot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ 'cellexia.widget.filter_media' | t }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if block.settings.show_product_links and cx_r.productHandle != blank -%}
      <div class="cx-overall__foot">
        {%- if cx_r_ptitle != blank -%}
        <a class="cx-overall__plink" href="{{ cx_r_purl }}#cellexia-reviews">{{ cx_r_ptitle | escape }}</a>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if cx_r_prc > 0 -%}
        <a class="cx-link cx-overall__read" href="{{ cx_r_purl }}#cellexia-reviews">{{ 'cellexia.overall.read_reviews' | t: count: cx_r_prc_str | replace: '[[count]]', cx_r_prc_str }}</a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </article>
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- if block.settings.cta_label != blank and block.settings.cta_url != blank -%}
  <div class="cx-overall__cta">
    <a class="cx-btn cx-btn--primary" href="{{ block.settings.cta_url }}">{{ block.settings.cta_label | escape }}</a>
  </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

{% render 'cx-i18n' %}
<script src="{{ 'cellexia-reviews.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:cellexia.overall_block.name",
  "target": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "t:cellexia.overall_block.settings.heading.label",
      "default": "t:cellexia.defaults.overall_heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "max_reviews",
      "label": "t:cellexia.overall_block.settings.max_reviews.label",
      "min": 3,
      "max": 12,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "layout",
      "label": "t:cellexia.overall_block.settings.layout.label",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "grid",
          "label": "t:cellexia.overall_block.settings.layout.options__1.label"
        },
        {
          "value": "carousel",
          "label": "t:cellexia.overall_block.settings.layout.options__2.label"
        }
      ],
      "default": "grid"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_distribution",
      "label": "t:cellexia.overall_block.settings.show_distribution.label",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_product_links",
      "label": "t:cellexia.overall_block.settings.show_product_links.label",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cta_label",
      "label": "t:cellexia.overall_block.settings.cta_label.label"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "cta_url",
      "label": "t:cellexia.overall_block.settings.cta_url.label"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
